ice argument."},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"value_type","note":"T"}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a gslice_array"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destroys a gslice_array"},{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns contents"},{"label":"operator+=, operator-=, operator*=, …","note":"performs arithmetic operation on the array referred by generic slice."}]},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"slice_array","note":"proxy to a subset of a valarray after applying a slice"},{"label":"mdspan","note":"a multi-dimensional non-owning array view"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":477,"codeBlockCount":2}
